      "foco": 960,
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Así que la planta es el hermano mayor, y las personas, el menor.",
          "en": "So the plant is the older brother, and people are the younger."
        },
        {
          "es": "El hermano mayor alimenta a la familia. El menor lo cuida.",
          "en": "The older brother feeds the family. The younger one cares for him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso, alrededor de un tazón de poi, puré de taro, las familias no pelean.",
          "en": "That's why, around a bowl of poi, mashed taro, families don't fight."
